1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,620
He came back Tuesday when the treatment hit hard

2
00:00:03,620 --> 00:00:06,980
I was shaking in the blankets, couldn't hold my own cup

3
00:00:06,980 --> 00:00:09,940
He leaned in close and said, "Ain't you tired yet?"

4
00:00:09,940 --> 00:00:13,060
I said, "Tired ain't the same as giving up"

5
00:00:13,060 --> 00:00:16,260
He pulled out a pocket watch, said, "Time is running low"

6
00:00:16,260 --> 00:00:19,460
I said, "Funny, so is your patience, partner, take it slow"

7
00:00:19,460 --> 00:00:22,820
Then my mama walked in, eyes red but standing tall

8
00:00:22,820 --> 00:00:26,020
And that old outlaw tipped his hat and backed into the hall

9
00:00:26,020 --> 00:00:30,500
He said, "Everybody's time comes, son, sooner or late"

10
00:00:32,340 --> 00:00:37,860
I said, "Then I reckon you can learn to wait"

11
00:00:38,240 --> 00:00:40,580
So take a number, take a number

12
00:00:40,580 --> 00:00:42,100
Pull a ticket off the roll

13
00:00:42,100 --> 00:00:43,700
You're gonna wait a long, long time

14
00:00:43,700 --> 00:00:45,380
Before you get a hold of my soul

15
00:00:45,380 --> 00:00:47,220
I got sunrises to finish

16
00:00:47,220 --> 00:00:48,660
I got promises to keep

17
00:00:48,660 --> 00:00:50,900
I got people I ain't done loving yet

18
00:00:50,900 --> 00:00:53,540
So take a number, take a seat
